      "formula": "theorem avg_twoPointEntropyCoord_le {n : ℕ} (j : Fin n)\n    (h : (Fin n → Bool) → ℝ) :\n    ∫ ε, twoPointEntropyCoord j h ε ∂(bernoulliUniform n) ≤\n    ∫ ε, (h ε - h (flipCoord j ε))^2 / 2 ∂(bernoulliUniform n)",
