      "formula": "theorem binaryKLfromUniform_weighted_le {p₀ p₁ w₀ w₁ : ℝ}\n    (hp₀ : p₀ ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) (hp₁ : p₁ ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1)\n    (hw₀ : 0 ≤ w₀) (hw₁ : 0 ≤ w₁) (hw_sum : w₀ + w₁ = 1) :\n    binaryKLfromUniform (w₀ * p₀ + w₁ * p₁) ≤\n    w₀ * binaryKLfromUniform p₀ + w₁ * binaryKLfromUniform p₁",
