      "formula": "theorem integral_flogf_decomp {n : ℕ} (f : (Fin (n + 1) → Bool) → ℝ) :\n    ∫ ε, f ε * log (f ε) ∂(bernoulliUniform (n+1)) =\n    ∫ ε', (f (Fin.snoc ε' true) * log (f (Fin.snoc ε' true)) +\n           f (Fin.snoc ε' false) * log (f (Fin.snoc ε' false))) / 2 ∂(bernoulliUniform n)",
