      "formula": "theorem jensenGap_eq_scaled_binaryKL {x y : ℝ} (hx : 0 ≤ x) (hy : 0 ≤ y) (hxy : 0 < x + y) :\n    jensenGap x y = ((x + y) / 2) * binaryKLfromUniform (x / (x + y))",
