      "formula": "theorem jensenGap_joint_convex (x₀ x₁ y₀ y₁ : ℝ)\n    (hx₀ : 0 ≤ x₀) (hx₁ : 0 ≤ x₁) (hy₀ : 0 ≤ y₀) (hy₁ : 0 ≤ y₁) :\n    2 * jensenGap ((x₀ + x₁) / 2) ((y₀ + y₁) / 2) ≤ jensenGap x₀ y₀ + jensenGap x₁ y₁",
