      "binder_policy": "exact printed declaration header retained; prerequisites derived at internal callers, never licensed as added final public premises",
      "formula": "theorem twoPointEnt_midpoint_convex (a₀ a₁ b₀ b₁ : ℝ)\n    (ha₀ : 0 ≤ a₀) (ha₁ : 0 ≤ a₁) (hb₀ : 0 ≤ b₀) (hb₁ : 0 ≤ b₁) :\n    twoPointEnt ((a₀ + a₁) / 2) ((b₀ + b₁) / 2) ≤\n    (twoPointEnt a₀ b₀ + twoPointEnt a₁ b₁) / 2",
      "id": "BernoulliLSI.twoPointEnt_midpoint_convex",
