      "formula": "theorem twoPointEntropyCoord_castSucc_eq_slice {n : ℕ} (j : Fin n)\n    (h : (Fin (n+1) → Bool) → ℝ) (ε' : Fin n → Bool) (b : Bool) :\n    twoPointEntropyCoord (Fin.castSucc j) h (Fin.snoc ε' b) =\n    twoPointEntropyCoord j (if b then sliceTrue h else sliceFalse h) ε'",
      "id": "BernoulliLSI.twoPointEntropyCoord_castSucc_eq_slice",
